# mTLS client credentials for the cloud router. Private keys — never commit, never ship in the APK.
# The app imports them at runtime into app-private storage instead.
/certificates
*.pem
*.jks
*.keystore

# The protoc descriptor set for MCAP schemas used to be generated into `src/main/assets` and needed
# ignoring here. It is written under `build/` now, one directory per variant, so nothing in the source
# tree is generated any more and there is nothing left to ignore.

# Recordings pulled off a phone to be measured against. Hundreds of megabytes of capture, and they are
# evidence for a particular question rather than anything the build needs — the figures that came out
# of them live in CLAUDE.md and `Capacity.kt`. A stray `git add -A` must not put one in a public repo.
/MCAP

# Byte-compiled helpers in tools/.
__pycache__/
